silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ThesisYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_01_thesis_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ThesisYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Thesis Anchor', the ingest_leg arrow witnesses the typed boundary from the raw source packet (TartuClinicIntakeForm) to the ingested encyclopedia entry (VetRecord_77) under the publish-factorization law of the free monad over EncyclopediaEntry.; also, In 'Thesis Anchor', the type_leg arrow assigns the DomesticCat / Felis catus / TSN 183798 typed node to VetRecord_77 under the Node-or-Arrow gate, keeping the type leg distinct from the Mittens colimit apex." .
